      "side": 1,
      "message": "I checked this on a quawks...it looks like you want TMP432_LOCAL_THERM_LIMIT instead as the THERM# pin is tied to EC_RESET. Also note that by default there is a 10C hysteresis on deasserting the THERM# pin so the device will need to cool down to 66C before booting back up (which is probably a good idea).",
